{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Pillcam Reminder 是一款用藥提醒工具，可為自己與家人建立多個個人檔案，透過手機通知準時提示服藥時間與劑量，並以拍照方式留下已服藥紀錄。適合需要長期服藥、照顧長者或兒童的家庭使用。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-183.webp\">\n<h2>多人家用藥提醒與拍照紀錄</h2>\n<p>應用提供準時可靠的手機通知，提醒服藥時間與應服用劑量，並支援每日固定服藥及每隔指定小時等彈性排程。你可為父母、子女或自己建立獨立檔案，集中切換檢視各人的服藥時間與遵循情況。服藥後可拍照標記為已服用，形成視覺化時間軸。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-61-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-62-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-63-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-64-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-65-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-66-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Pillcam Reminder: Med Tracker</li>\n<li>應用類別：Medical</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T09:18:47.082130+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":301,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T09:11:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T05:17:47.783151+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T09:17:34.363527+00:00","content_hash":"147abea4872b8a8aa26dd9ef0b63b63fbbe8229fcff11d98660ee1363fb9e692","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}